# Hand-made and pre-migration copies: flo.db.bak-20260921,
# flo.db.pre-v107-<timestamp> and their -shm/-wal siblings. A suffix after
# ".db" escapes all three patterns above, so these carry real order and
# customer data and would otherwise show up as untracked, one `git add -A`
# away from a public push.
flo.db.*
# Intentional exception: a real committed DB fixture for the upgrade-path
# regression test (tests/upgrade-path.test.ts, specs/DatabaseMigrations.md).
!tests/fixtures/upgrade-snapshots/*.db
